      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As of a few updates ago to the VRC SDK, this issue can now be worked around by putting the required mask on the top layer of the FX controller and the animations on other layers (previously, the mask on the top layer in FX was ignored). The other layers will inherit the masking from the top layer, but since those layers don't have masks themselves, it avoids the Unity bug preventing material swap animation of all but slot 0.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
